    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test the classification of bodies—memorize whether an organization is Constitutional (e.g., CAG), Statutory (e.g., NHRC, CVC), or Executive (e.g., NITI Aayog).",
        "Understand the difference in establishment: Statutory bodies require parliamentary legislation, whereas Non-Statutory bodies are formed via cabinet resolution.",
        "Pay attention to the specific Acts and functional limitations associated with key statutory bodies like NGT, CVC, and CIC."
      ],
